{"id":"n4-064","title":"Verb る ことがある","romaji":"〜ru koto ga aru","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Used to express that something happens sometimes or has happened before.","longExplanation":"The grammar point る ことがある is used to express that something occurs sometimes or has occurred in the past. It indicates that the action is not a regular or constant event, but rather something that takes place occasionally or has happened at least once.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + ことがある","examples":[{"jp":"彼は遅刻することがあります。","romaji":"Kare wa chikoku suru koto ga arimasu.","en":"He is sometimes late.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅刻","vocabId":"1422050","reading":"ちこく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"私は寝坊することがあります。","romaji":"Watashi wa nebou suru koto ga arimasu.","en":"I sometimes oversleep.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"寝坊","vocabId":"1360320","reading":"ねぼう"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼女は歌を歌うことがあります。","romaji":"Kanojo wa uta o utau koto ga arimasu.","en":"She sometimes sings songs.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歌","vocabId":"1193180","reading":"うた"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歌う","vocabId":"1588120","reading":"うたう"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"子供の頃、よく山に登ることがありました。","romaji":"Kodomo no koro, yoku yama ni noboru koto ga arimashita.","en":"When I was a child, I sometimes climbed mountains.","words":[{"surface":"子供の頃","vocabId":"2827554","reading":"こどものころ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よく","vocabId":"1547320","reading":"よく"},{"surface":"山","vocabId":"1302680","reading":"やま"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"登る","vocabId":"1352570","reading":"のぼる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]}],"kind":"construction"}